1: /**
2:  * Cinejoy webOS - Application Bootstrap & View Router
3:  * 10-Foot Television User Interface Controller
4:  * Manages view switching (#home, #movies, #series, #search, #details, #player),
5:  * active nav indicators, and spatial focus coordination.
6:  */
