 * 
 * Simulates 7 authentic living room TV user journeys using real JSDOM,
 * real application modules (CinejoyApp, SpatialNav, PlayerController,
 * PlayerOSDController, DetailsViewController, SearchViewController, HomeViewController),
 * and real DOM event dispatches:
 * 
 * - Scenario 1: Cold Boot to Hero Playback (F3, F4, F5, F8, F9)
 * - Scenario 2: Catalog Browsing & Shelf Navigation across all 6 shelves (F3, F4, F5)
 * - Scenario 3: TV Series Binge Experience: Season tab to Episode Play (F4, F5, F6, F8, F9)
 * - Scenario 4: Live Search & Back Focus Retention (F4, F5, F7, F6)
 * - Scenario 5: Stream Failure & Graceful Recovery with Server Switch (F2, F8, F9, F10)
 * - Scenario 6: Extended Viewing & Resume Playback from localStorage (F8, F9, F10)
 * - Scenario 7: Full Hierarchical Navigation Session & Backstack Unwind (F3, F4, F5, F6, F7, F8, F9)
 * 
 * Exactly 7 scenario checks total.
 */

